# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Employee Offboarding Process
**Document ID**: HR-013
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Version**: 2.1 (January 2025)

---

## Overview

This document outlines the process for employee departures, whether voluntary or involuntary. The goal is to ensure smooth transitions, protect company assets, and maintain positive relationships.

---

## Types of Separation

| Type | Definition | Notice |
|------|------------|--------|
| Voluntary Resignation | Employee-initiated departure | 2 weeks standard |
| Retirement | Voluntary departure from workforce | 30+ days preferred |
| Involuntary - Performance | Termination for performance issues | Per HR process |
| Involuntary - Conduct | Termination for policy violation | Immediate possible |
| Involuntary - Position Elimination | Role no longer exists | Per WARN Act if applicable |
| Mutual Separation | Agreed-upon departure | Negotiated |

---

## Resignation Process

### Employee Responsibilities

| Timeline | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Upon decision | Notify manager verbally |
| Same day | Submit written resignation to HR |
| Notice period | Complete knowledge transfer |
| Final week | Complete offboarding checklist |
| Last day | Return equipment, badge |

### Manager Responsibilities

| Timeline | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Upon notification | Notify HR immediately |
| Within 24 hours | Decide on counteroffer (if applicable) |
| Within 48 hours | Announce to team (after HR approval) |
| Notice period | Oversee knowledge transfer |
| Notice period | Plan work redistribution |
| Final day | Conduct farewell |

### HR Responsibilities

| Timeline | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Day 1 | Create separation record in Workday |
| Day 1 | Notify IT, Security, Payroll |
| Day 1-2 | Schedule exit interview |
| Notice period | Prepare final pay calculations |
| Final day | Collect equipment |
| Final day | Disable access (coordinated with IT) |
| Day +3 | Send COBRA information |
| Day +30 | Process final paycheck/expenses |

