## Notice Period

### Standard Notice Periods

| Level | Required Notice | Garden Leave Option |
|-------|-----------------|---------------------|
| IC1-IC3 | 2 weeks | No |
| IC4-IC6 | 2 weeks | Manager discretion |
| M1-M2 | 2 weeks | Yes |
| D1-D2 | 4 weeks | Yes |
| VP+ | 4 weeks | Yes |
| C-Suite | Per contract | Per contract |

### Garden Leave
- Paid, but employee doesn't work
- Used for competitive risk situations
- Access revoked immediately
- Benefits continue through garden leave

### Pay in Lieu of Notice
Company may offer pay instead of working notice:
- Employee paid for notice period
- Depart immediately
- Access revoked same day

