## Exit Interview

### Process

| Step | Details |
|------|---------|
| Scheduling | HR schedules within first week of notice |
| Interviewer | HR Business Partner (not direct manager) |
| Format | 30-minute video or in-person |
| Confidentiality | Aggregated and anonymized |

### Exit Interview Topics

- Reason for leaving
- Experience at MedSync
- Manager feedback
- Team dynamics
- Career development experiences
- Compensation competitiveness
- Suggestions for improvement
- Would you return? Recommend MedSync?

### Data Usage
- Themes reported quarterly to leadership
- Individual feedback anonymized
- Specific safety concerns escalated
- Retention insights developed

