## Equipment Return

### Company Property to Return

| Item | Return Method |
|------|---------------|
| Laptop | In-person or prepaid shipping |
| Monitors | In-person or prepaid shipping |
| Phone (if company-issued) | In-person or prepaid shipping |
| Badge/access cards | Final day, in-person |
| Parking permits | Final day |
| Company credit cards | Cut up, confirm with Finance |
| Keys | Final day |
| Documents/files | Digital deleted, physical returned |

### Remote Employee Equipment Return

1. Receive prepaid shipping box from IT
2. Pack all equipment securely
3. Ship within 5 business days of last day
4. Confirm receipt with IT
5. Failure to return: Paycheck deduction may apply

