## Final Pay

### Final Paycheck Components

| Component | Timing |
|-----------|--------|
| Salary through last day | Next regular payroll |
| Accrued expenses | Within 30 days |
| Unused California PTO (CA employees) | With final pay |
| Bonus (if earned) | Normal bonus cycle |
| Commission (if earned) | Per sales comp plan |

### California Specific
- Final pay due immediately if terminated
- Final pay due within 72 hours if resigned with notice
- All earned PTO paid out

