## Stock Options

### Vested Options

| Departure Type | Exercise Window |
|----------------|-----------------|
| Voluntary (<2 years) | 90 days |
| Voluntary (2+ years) | 10 years |
| Involuntary (not cause) | 90 days |
| Involuntary (cause) | 0 days (forfeited) |
