## Involuntary Termination

### Performance-Based

| Step | Timeline |
|------|----------|
| PIP creation | Following review cycle |
| PIP duration | 30-60 days |
| Final decision | End of PIP |
| Termination meeting | HR + Manager present |
| Last day | Usually same day |

### Conduct-Based

| Severity | Process |
|----------|---------|
| Minor violations | Progressive discipline |
| Serious violations | Immediate investigation |
| Gross misconduct | Immediate termination possible |

### Position Elimination

| Process | Timeline |
|---------|----------|
| Business case approved | VP + HR |
| WARN Act assessment | Legal review |
| Employee notification | Per WARN (60 days if applicable) |
| Severance offered | Per policy |
| Outplacement support | If >10 employees affected |

