## Alumni Relations

### MedSync Alumni Network
- LinkedIn group for former employees
- Quarterly newsletter
- Rehire consideration (good standing only)
- Reference policy: Dates and titles confirmed

### Boomerang (Rehire) Policy
- Eligible if left in good standing
